  "sample": {
    "description": "Annual UK macro data 1271-2022 from Bank of England Millennium dataset (Ryland et al. 2018) 1271-2016 vintage spliced to 2022: England real GDP per capita (A21 col8, 2013 prices), CPI (A47 preferred spliced 2015=100), M0 per capita and broad money M4 spliced (A24). First 50 obs 1271-1320 used as training for OLS priors (appendix). Total years 1271-2022 N=752 (vs paper 752), estimation sample 1321-2022 N=702 after differencing/lags; 4-var extension with Bank Rate 1700-2022 N=323. 2017-2022 spliced via ONS: ABMI chained-volume GDP (PN2), CPI D7BT (MM23, 2015=100), UKPOP mid-year population; World Bank WDI FM.LBL.BMNY.CN broad money (current LCU) for M4/M0 growth. Counts after filtering: raw Millennium 1271-2016 N=746 \u2192 +6 spliced \u2192 752 \u2192 training drop 50 \u2192 estimation 702 years theoretical, 702 usable after VAR(2) lags.",
